# GitHub's windows-latest runners check out with core.autocrlf=true. Several
# security tests match exact multi-line source anchors (the 26 Phase 5 mutants
# in noosphere-mcp/tests/replay-mutation.test.js) and byte-exact document and
# record digests, all of which a CRLF checkout silently breaks. Normalize every
# text file to LF in the index and on checkout, on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
